    },
    "message": "Test each moved rule by a state that breaks it, adapt the shadows, write down lane L7\n\nThe after_tick shadow compares the Rust memo with what it must hold and probes broken copies;\nthe population shadow compares the memo's unchanged facts with the bytes; the metrics shadow\nruns the entity rules after each passed check. Docs: lane L7, architecture, native README.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01K4QyYRukuCLBerKa4UYj4y",
